summary: Checks for config differences between releases.
description: |2
     Check for kconfig changes between releases. The check is done on the config of the system under test against a config of your choosing.
contact: Stephen Bertram <sbertram@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
require:
  - diffutils
duration: 10m
extra-summary: /kernel-tests/core-kernel/configs_diff
extra-task: /kernel-tests/core-kernel/configs_diff
